Package: com.wcvoicekeep
Name: wcvoicekeep
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Zero-jump voice input for WeChat Keyboard (Wetype). daemon keeps the main app alive and pokes an injected dylib (via TrollFools) to establish native PiP standby, so the keyboard extension never force-jumps. The dylib is injected by TrollFools (not MobileSubstrate) to bypass the app's anti-injection self-kill.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
